OL,3,GNEWSANHS staff face sack for snooping  
OL,4,Aon patients' records                   
OL,6,FNHS workers have been warned they could
OL,7,Fbe sacked if they look at patient      
OL,8,Frecords without good reason.           
OL,10,FTraining making the rules clear to     
OL,11,Fstaff will come amid a crackdown by NHS
OL,12,FEngland following a raft of            
OL,13,Fhigh-profile cases of records being    
OL,14,Flooked at inappropriately.             
OL,16,FIt included staff accessing the medical
OL,17,Frecords of victims of the Southport    
OL,18,Fknife attack, which yoga teacher Leanne
OL,19,FLucas said made her feel "violated".   
