OL,3,GNEWSANHS staff face sack for snooping  
OL,4,Aon patients' records                   
OL,6,FIt comes after figures obtained by the 
OL,7,FPress Association found more than 3,000
OL,8,Finstances of health workers viewing    
OL,9,Fpatient records in the last five years,
OL,10,Fwith the highest reported number of    
OL,11,Fincidents - 242 between 2021 and 2026 -
OL,12,Fat Morecambe Bay NHS Foundation Trust. 
